# Small fixtures under tests/fixtures/docs/ are committed, including the 749 KB Persian
# book: it is the only proof that NFKC is required, it pins the lost-space limitation,
# and two tests fail without it. Only the 10 MB English sample book is ignored -- it is
# parsed once by scripts/build_pdf_fixtures.py, which commits a 12-page excerpt instead,
// and its test skips when the file is absent.
/tests/fixtures/docs/en/Clean Code Fundamentals-Martin Hock-Leanpub-EBooksWorld.ir.pdf